<Layout title="Activities & community" description="Tanzil Ahmed’s experience in debate, club leadership, theatre, mime, coding education, volunteering and scouting.">
  <div class="container page-body"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Leadership, performance & volunteering</p><h1>Activities &<br/><span class="serif-word">community.</span></h1><p>Alongside software, I’ve spent time organizing debates, performing on stage, teaching, and volunteering. Here’s what that involved.</p></header>
    <div class="life-stories"><section class="life-story" id="debate"><span class="life-number">01 /</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Club leadership & competitions</p><h2>Debate &<br/><span class="serif-word">leadership.</span></h2><p>I founded and served as president of the debating club at Faizur Rahman Ideal Institute. With support from the school administration, I organized two inter-school debate tournaments and outreach events.</p><p>As a debater, I reached the final of A+ Peitho Open 2023 and was a runner-up at BUTEXDC National Debate Festival 2022. Organizing tournaments also introduced me to Tabbycat and the practical needs of debate software.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/#recognition">View competition results<Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><div class="life-art debate-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Listen.</span><span>Question.</span><span>Understand.</span><span class="art-plus">↗</span></div></section>
    <section class="life-story" id="theatre"><span class="life-number">02 /</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Stage performance</p><h2>Theatre &<br/><span class="serif-word">mime.</span></h2><p>With Duronto Cultural Academy and Gollachut Natyadol, I performed in more than 25 stage productions, including 15 community shows and 10 paid performances.</p><p>I also wrote scripts and choreographed original performances. Working with a cast taught me to prepare, collaborate, and communicate with an audience.</p></div><div class="life-art theatre-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="theatre-line"></span><span>Theatre<br/>& mime.</span><span class="art-plus">✳</span></div></section>
    <section class="life-story" id="teaching"><span class="life-number">03 /</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Education & community service</p><h2>Teaching &<br/><span class="serif-word">volunteering.</span></h2><p>Through BECEF Network, I taught introductory coding to more than 50 students and helped with website development. On Learn with Tanzil, I produced more than 30 Bangla tutorials about coding, HTML, and technology.</p><p>With Phulkuri Ashar, I took part in children’s welfare campaigns and fundraising, and taught basic math and English. I also participated in Bangladesh Scouts, including two national camps.</p><a class="text-link" href="/open-source/">View learning-resource contributions<Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div><div class="life-art teaching-art" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="sprout" size={100}/><span>Learn.<br/>Share.<br/>Repeat.</span></div></section></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
